WEBVTT

00:23:58.038 --> 00:24:00.996
where you can say I want music generated
for me in this style

00:24:00.996 --> 00:24:03.913
or this kind of stuff, and it can
come up with the words as well.

00:24:03.913 --> 00:24:09.996
And it's like pretty cool. And I really
enjoy listening to music that it creates.

00:24:09.996 --> 00:24:13.788
And I can sort of do four songs, two bars
of a jingle, whatever you'd like.

00:24:14.413 --> 00:24:17.746
And one of my very favorite
artists reached out,

00:24:17.746 --> 00:24:21.663
called to open it after we release this
and said that he wanted to talk.

00:24:21.663 --> 00:24:25.163
And I was like, well, I like total fanboy
here. I'd love to join that call.

00:24:25.454 --> 00:24:28.246
And I was so nervous that he was
going to say, this is terrible.

00:24:28.246 --> 00:24:30.579
This is like a really sad thing
for human creativity.